at the same  time matthew said to entertainment  weekly if you have to pick a business  not to go into with an identical twin  this is it we didn't talk for a long  time  best known for cleaning teeth as david  silver's dad mel on beverly hills 90210  matthew was born four minutes later than  his twin elder brother mitchell shared  his twins opinions on the entertainment  business saying at times i hate the fact  that matthew's here we have moments of  closeness and a lot of times of conflict  the two were able to get past their  differences and collaborated several  times including for a pair of cop rock  episodes and an appearance on the  commish on saturday night live matthew  was a featured player in season six  while mitchell held various roles  eventually becoming an associate  director in the memorable outer limits  episode in another life mitchell played  a man trapped in an alternate reality  surrounded by many different versions of  himself which were played by both he and  matthew when mitchell decided it was  time to leave the soap opera santa  barbara and move on to reasonable doubts  matthew was there to take his place the  two have since moved away from hollywood  and into the world of golf podcasting  matthew hosts the backspin golf radio  show and podcast for espn while mitchell  is the co-host and co-producer of  talking golf getaways with mitch and  darren  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite actors are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

